                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a0ba3213-bc8c-3975-b8c0-bdc7849a42cf",
                        "entry_id": "0b840161-d046-3235-be9a-20146584ff4f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "то же, что полоз; приспособление для перемещения по ровной поверхности путём скольжения"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "861e7581-7f75-481b-b840-dd89b9c99280",
                                "sense_id": "a0ba3213-bc8c-3975-b8c0-bdc7849a42cf",
                                "text": "Трехколёсное шасси самолёта было заменено на одно подпружиненное тормозное колесо вблизи центра тяжести планера и носовую короткую лыжу с обрезиненным роликом."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7e9e2624-7ad3-39c1-8f09-6bd51ff1cc8a",
                        "entry_id": "0b840161-d046-3235-be9a-20146584ff4f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "лыжа [1] для перемещения человека по снегу, как правило, используемая в паре"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "aea68bcb-bb44-4cf1-8384-c93c95f671d6",
                                "sense_id": "7e9e2624-7ad3-39c1-8f09-6bd51ff1cc8a",
                                "text": "В последний день при падении у Жени порвалось крепление, и мы чуть не потеряли лыжу."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "83bb41de-8fb0-40ae-9bd9-1da10e86231f",
                                "sense_id": "7e9e2624-7ad3-39c1-8f09-6bd51ff1cc8a",
                                "text": "Убедитесь, что на подошве ботинка нет снега, прежде чем надевать лыжи: снег на подошве может мешать срабатыванию креплений."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bfd4db6c-aeb6-4457-8f94-d7c8cb68573d",
                        "source_entry_id": "0b840161-d046-3235-be9a-20146584ff4f",
                        "target_lang_word": "ski",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ski",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "16b6e0c4-603d-39ba-b33d-ddd9f7c66233",
                                        "entry_id": "f5aac9e2-144c-32fb-aa47-b5053f973ad7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One of a pair of long flat runners designed for gliding over snow or water."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "39199f6c-8dd5-4fb0-9182-3dbf5322bbf7",
                                                "sense_id": "16b6e0c4-603d-39ba-b33d-ddd9f7c66233",
                                                "text": "Disaster at the newly opened ski resort where hard-driving tycoon Hudson is determined to double his not insubstantial investment while his ex-wife Mia is making whoopee with one of the locals championing ecology."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b8115326-b043-49bd-908f-f0a85b9261a6",
                                                "sense_id": "16b6e0c4-603d-39ba-b33d-ddd9f7c66233",
                                                "text": "We skied back the way we had come for about thirty minutes when I saw her. Mary was hanging upside down by the tips of her skies from a tree well."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a6a71344-1628-4828-a09b-8019e494e594",
                                                "sense_id": "16b6e0c4-603d-39ba-b33d-ddd9f7c66233",
                                                "text": "Yilamujiang grew up in Altay, a prefecture bordering Mongolia in far northwest Xinjiang. Chinese officials consider the region the cradle of Alpine sport, after cave paintings of hunters on skis were dated at 10,000 years old. Locals still use hand-carved wooden skis covered in a horsehide, although mostly now for the benefit of tourists."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8aae2b46-aaa1-3d35-b2a7-9146f6e92362",
                                        "entry_id": "f5aac9e2-144c-32fb-aa47-b5053f973ad7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One of a pair of long flat runners under some flying machines, used for landing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "81d86d03-fb33-3d37-9a77-fccd22498a8e",
                                        "entry_id": "f5aac9e2-144c-32fb-aa47-b5053f973ad7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A trip made by skiing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9451cc20-a5fd-47b5-8f86-d146afe9ee02",
                                                "sense_id": "81d86d03-fb33-3d37-9a77-fccd22498a8e",
                                                "text": "to go for a ski"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "ski",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "82e54ebf-d851-3dbb-9034-bb284f2c8135",
                                        "entry_id": "9fc18ca5-b8f7-3add-b22c-3fa4d7cce760",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To move on skis."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e6c0f3d1-b047-40fe-b2d5-dc5a76f763b2",
                                                "sense_id": "82e54ebf-d851-3dbb-9034-bb284f2c8135",
                                                "text": "Townsend hare inhabit this area, particularly above the cabin, and a skier is likely to have one explode from a tree well and disappear into the whiteness as he skis by. Life is a constant bivouac for them -- they spend days huddled in tree wells during storms -- but I suspect they are as content and warm in their luxurious coats as we are in a cabin."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2c9bdbd4-cc48-4670-b443-86b7148349a8",
                                                "sense_id": "82e54ebf-d851-3dbb-9034-bb284f2c8135",
                                                "text": "We skied back the way we had come for about thirty minutes when I saw her. Mary was hanging upside down by the tips of her skies from a tree well."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "44b3aec4-060d-3cd7-b73b-e49bf89d85ed",
                                        "entry_id": "9fc18ca5-b8f7-3add-b22c-3fa4d7cce760",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To travel over (a slope, etc.) on skis; to travel on skis at (a place), (especially as a sport)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b3b1c337-302f-45a5-a133-1f215a5964b9",
                                                "sense_id": "44b3aec4-060d-3cd7-b73b-e49bf89d85ed",
                                                "text": "We spent the winter holidays skiing the Alps"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "024bc7ea-c442-4ec1-a086-5a310ddf5100",
                        "source_entry_id": "0b840161-d046-3235-be9a-20146584ff4f",
                        "target_lang_word": "ski",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ski",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "51bcddc6-548b-3bf9-a97f-e11821ccfec9",
                                        "entry_id": "98920dd4-17a5-304f-9252-6c2af0224eb5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Patin très long, légèrement recourbé en avant, qui sert à glisser sur la neige."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f6f872de-12c2-48db-b05d-da54843183fa",
                                                "sense_id": "51bcddc6-548b-3bf9-a97f-e11821ccfec9",
                                                "text": "Des skis."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "188f2c7d-34e9-38ba-942a-7edc302af405",
                                        "entry_id": "98920dd4-17a5-304f-9252-6c2af0224eb5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sport de glisse sur neige ou sur eau, pratiqué à l’aide de ces accessoires."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bbed1e5a-c6d9-4122-87b4-a2b77565519b",
                                                "sense_id": "188f2c7d-34e9-38ba-942a-7edc302af405",
                                                "text": "Le jeune homme a expliqué que l’un des problèmes auxquels il faisait face lorsqu’il s’adressait aux autorités résidait dans le fait que le mot « ski » n’existe pas en tétum, l’une des deux langues officielles du Timor oriental, et qu’on y parle plutôt de « patins à neige »."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4d28914b-3789-4170-957c-1ee4ba5b9f00",
                                                "sense_id": "188f2c7d-34e9-38ba-942a-7edc302af405",
                                                "text": "En effet, à Noël, les conditions d’enneigement sont insuffisantes pour le ski plus d’un hiver sur deux dans la plupart des domaines skiables du Massif central, en raison du caractère très aléatoire de l’enneigement de début de saison."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "ski",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d13f8114-89ac-3d50-941f-8757fbc2b9fe",
                                        "entry_id": "f0c67a81-89e1-39fb-84a1-7168ea2bc8fd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pluriel de ski."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "note": "Certains auteurs conservent le pluriel norvégien ski du norvégien ski",
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1733ead0-0f66-4dc4-b488-2e69c16afb09",
                                                "sense_id": "d13f8114-89ac-3d50-941f-8757fbc2b9fe",
                                                "text": "Les patins norvégiens, les ski, nom sous lequel nous les désignerons désormais, sont de longues et étroites lamelles de bois, permettant d’avancer rapidement sans enfoncer sur neige. Dimensions des ski: longueur 2,30 m à 3 m ; largeur 0,09 m. Les ski ne doivent pas être confondus avec les raquettes en usage dans les Alpes et dans l’Amérique du Nord et qui ont principalement pour but d’empêcher d’enfoncer dans la neige pulvérulente. (N.d.T)"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
